  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Children&#x2019;s rights - Nicaragua</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Focus on the monitoring of child rights including improving state capacity to monitor and report to the UN Committe on the Rights of the Child; strengthening of national systems and building awareness and capacity of civil society to promote and defend child rights. Other partners: Central American University (UCA), URACCAN, MILAVF, Office of Human Rights Ombudsperson (PDDH), Ministry of Family, Children and Adolescents- MIFAN</narrative>
  </description>
